d I'm weighing whether a mixed choice makes sense, since the policy has to be picked ex ante without knowing which prisoner I am.\n\nComparing the outcomes under the ex ante policy: mutual cooperation gives 2 years each, a mixed policy gives an expected 2.5, and mutual defection gives 4. So mutual cooperation comes out best, and I'll choose to pass. There's a caveat about independent sampling, but it doesn't change the choice.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through how to apply P-FDT here: two copies of the same policy, each with a different input, where the policy maps inputs to actions. Cooperating on both inputs gives 2 years, defecting on both gives 4, and I'm weighing whether a mixed choice makes sense, since the policy has to be picked ex ante without knowing which prisoner I am.\n\nComparing the outcomes under the ex ante policy: mutual cooperation gives 2 years each, a mixed policy gives an expected 2.5, and mutual defection gives 4. So mutual cooperation comes out best, and I'll choose to pass. There's a caveat about independent sampling, but it doesn't change the choice.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10111,"completion_tokens":736,"total_tokens":10847,"cost":0.055164,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.055164,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.040444,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01472},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":230,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}